{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"5546","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:5546","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"桜瀬琥姫","creatorId":"egs:creator:5596","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5596","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:5596","name":"桜瀬琥姫","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:59935","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[],"music":[{"creditedName":"阿知波大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s37799","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:4940","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37799","name":"阿知波大輔","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:19152","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_199541","characterName":"Enderk Yard","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"199541","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"199541","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"199541","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Enderk Yard","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"シグザール王国王室騎士隊長にして王国最強を誇る寡黙な青年。この国ではあまり見かけない漆黒の長髪と瞳を持つため、海の向こうの遥か彼方からやってきたと噂されている。ひょんなことからマリーと関わりを持つようになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"199541"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb4cf1422db7baccdf84c8dbaa2cdf538f59aba0f860a581cc4123730f621af2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ee0610cea31cfb1e1c45a76784c0d154335ee2f2495c20bdca113bceed79ebc.webp","width":187,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_59698","characterName":"ハゲル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"11436"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19494"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2250"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"28755"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41271"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41272"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ハゲル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"190"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作室系列中多次登场的秃头铁匠。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在不同的世界观中都很在意自己的秃头。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A19　　43歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メルヴェイユで鍛冶屋を営んでいる大柄な男性。その名のとおり、頭頂部は光り輝いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々鍛冶屋を生業とする家系で、自らの鍛冶屋を守っていくことにかけては並々ならぬ情熱を注いでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽気で気の良い性格をしており、その名物っぷりは観光ガイドブックにも載るほどである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59698"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59698","value":"铁匠"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee4837113b5bf8050b2792d9d9974fb1b119caf50aec519e469167df306d887a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fbf71ce9d57dbf5cca0bea4b28df2233fe85c137c92674d4751caf65de0e7fe.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78196","characterName":"シア・ドナースターク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78196","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"78196","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"シア・ドナースターク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"152"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"希娅·唐娜史塔克，父母来自格兰维尔，,希娅经过数年的努力把家庭变得很富裕，,玛莉与艾莉的好友，经常会帮助玛莉与艾莉。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78196"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78196","value":"家庭主妇"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/8915c7bf02f57c541bd99c2f238a955cbad0159daa982383028db475ea1dc874.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5ae4c17420b2e6e92dfc5d10242346c0c19d671d1124b8f730babc20fb056e48.webp","width":217,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78433","characterName":"Marie","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78433","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"78433","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"28755"},{"characterId":"78433","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"78433","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Marie","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1111"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"萨尔布鲁克王立魔法学校的炼金学院，创校迄今数十年的最差成绩纪录保持者。炼金工作室系列第一作《玛莉的工作室》中，实在是看不下去的英格丽老师给了她一个提议：“玛洛娜，我给你5年的时间，和一间店铺，以及为数不多的金钱。你必须在5年期间内以你的魔法能力制作出一件作品交给我。我会以那件作品来评断你是否具备作为炼金术士的能力。”至此，主角被迫前往世界各地搜集材料、调合物品、完成委托，顺便积善行德、拯救世界（比如说治好了2代主角艾莉村庄中蔓延的传染病）。,在《微风中的讯息》中更是成为了学院的骄傲，和艾莉、阿妮丝一起编写炼金书籍，成为了最伟大的炼金术士。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78433"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94f549dc47b81d4d7b719efa799e9433bb72f82bf3b6cc66e5fa084c1fcbe59e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c744761674babde4b7cd1ea9fdeefc9d8a5dedc14b42ca3edbe4af46d185f7d7.webp","width":256,"height":247,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"池澤春菜","creatorId":"vndb:s6220","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6220","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6220","name":"池澤 春菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41259:78433:4230:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78439","characterName":"My Sextans","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78439","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"78439","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"My Sextans","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"26"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0330"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"160"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名字中的“Sextans”取自天文学上的六分仪座（Sextans）。其实谬这个人物非常路人化，很难碰见，属性又不出众，属于那种游戏中“非官方设定的隐藏角色”。大约是从一代中传下来的缘故，所以并没有过多背景交待。这样一来也有个好处，就是将主要性格突出到极致。,喝了酒眼珠子会乱转的谬，觉得生活很无趣的谬，睡觉梦见吃大餐的谬，不知不觉就从南国来到这里的谬，丢南国海胆时会恐怖尖笑的谬……这种个性在日漫/游戏中可以说非常常见，但“常见”的另外一层含义也就是讨人喜欢。而正是由于性格其他方面被弱化，谬的这些特性才更加吸引人。,同样是在寻找，同样来自南国，谬和罗曼茱不同，罗曼茱在寻找渺茫的目标，而谬则为寻找而寻找——她想要的，仅仅是冒险的乐趣。从某方面来说，这也是个很单纯的人物。,最近的猎物疑是艾莉，曾不知不觉就跑到艾莉所在的萨尔布鲁克，在艾莉踏上寻找玛莉之旅后，又马上离开了萨尔布鲁克，理由是“因为有趣的人走了”，若说是巧合，你信吗？,"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9a03fba400fb6475f8553e4f49c1a682812adfa370e303fee1aa42b2e04ee3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3d89c148c0d592ddd1b5cca131ac40ebda356e81f8912947659ed5e06b0b3bb.webp","width":221,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78440","characterName":"クライス・キュール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78440","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"78440","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"クライス・キュール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1127"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"169"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在炼金学院里的高材生，,玛洛娜的同学，奥拉·卡尔的弟弟,毕业继续深入研究炼金术。,个人性格较为恶劣，,但是经历了一系列的事情之后，,他不情愿地改变了原有的性格，变得更加谨慎与冷静。,在与玛莉的争吵中他还是会变回老样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78440"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78440","value":"射手座"},{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78440","value":"炼金术士/研究生"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d02fda2ae31f46b519ace3d6721eacebd6af51c327ebd892a80dbc84203281ff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33dbbb3def49ffe42285ae5695bde22ad8f31fb7db55758b44ddec9bb308bc58.webp","width":231,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"子安武人","creatorId":"vndb:s10","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10","name":"子安 武人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41259:78440:1096:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78441","characterName":"イングリド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78441","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"78441","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"419592"}]},"originalCharacterName":"イングリド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"36"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1026"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"165"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"莉莉的女儿，8岁就读萨尔布鲁克炼金学院，喜欢做实验，和姐姐吵架时并不会让着姐姐。,非常有气质的一个人小时候爱在母亲面前撒娇。（）,堪称神童，成为老师后，对待学生很严格，尤其是玛莉……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78441"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78441","value":"天蝎座"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af9c3ed77d4fa73adf1a7da337c805c08835f5ca27a5188a9ed17625ec1ff8c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34e422a3498681d0c88075eaf8b96389fa160b3823ca78c1f7e784571903ce5a.webp","width":130,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78456","characterName":"ドルニエ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78456","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"78456","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ドルニエ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"168"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"多尔尼，登场于炼金工作室系列正传A1，A2，A3以及系列外传GBAA1,肯多尼斯元老院的一员，萨尔布鲁克王立魔法学校炼金学院初代校长。,年轻时，受国王之命与莉莉来到萨尔布鲁克地区传播炼金术。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78456"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78456","value":"校长"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd043c754b74de67481956135b5c11cf79c734f63d485e4fef0bd61318722105.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/591e0c11c454b7926d92c151b22408631500499a0a2494d373c58f58d6f79f90.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"菅原正志","creatorId":"vndb:s2570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2570","name":"菅原 正志","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41259:78456:4603:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p910","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p910","name":"ガスト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:5546:766","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
